  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "ipip_likert_1": "Very Inaccurate",
      "ipip_likert_2": "Moderately Inaccurate",
      "ipip_likert_3": "Neither Accurate Nor Inaccurate",
      "ipip_likert_4": "Moderately Accurate",
      "ipip_likert_5": "Very Accurate",
      "ipip_question_head": "<h3>How Accurately Can You Describe Yourself?</h3><p>Describe yourself as you generally are now, not as you wish to be in the future. Describe yourself as you honestly see yourself, in relation to other people you know of the same sex as you are, and roughly your same age. So that you can describe yourself in an honest manner, your responses will be kept in absolute confidence. Indicate the accuracy of the item as it applies to you, using the following rating scale:</p>",
      "ipip_debrief": "Thank you for completing this questionnaire.",
      "ipip_Y1": "Am not a very enthusiastic person.",
      "ipip_N01": "Was bothered by things that usually don't bother me.",
      "ipip_E1": "Automatically take charge.",
      "ipip_A1": "Like to watch children open presents.",
      "ipip_H1": "Feel at ease with people.",
      "ipip_V1": "Find the world a very interesting place.",
      "ipip_C1": "Worry a lot about catching a serious illness.",
      "ipip_R1": "Am a person whose moods go up and down easily.",
      "ipip_R2": "Forget things.",
      "ipip_N02": "Had a poor appetite.",
      "ipip_V2": "Go out of my way to attend educational events.",
      "ipip_X2": "Love children's movies.",
      "ipip_A2": "Dislike being around happy people when I'm feeling sad.",
      "ipip_X3": "Am willing to try anything once.",
      "ipip_A3": "Shout or scream when I'm angry.",
      "ipip_E3": "Try to please everyone.",
      "ipip_N03": "Did not feel like eating, even though I should have been hungry.",
      "ipip_R3": "Prefer fear to boredom.",
      "ipip_H3": "Show my feelings.",
      "ipip_B3": "Found myself in a place and had no idea how I had gotten there.",
      "ipip_A4": "Find it difficult showing people that I care about them.",
      "ipip_H4": "Do most of the talking.",
      "ipip_N04": "Felt that I could not shake off the blues, even with help from my family or friends.",
      "ipip_B4": "Found myself dressed in clothes I didn't remember putting on.",
      "ipip_E4": "Dwell on the past.",
      "ipip_D4": "Seldom notice the emotional aspects of paintings and pictures.",
      "ipip_V4": "Try to identify the reasons for my actions.",
      "ipip_C4": "Am usually active and full of energy.",
      "ipip_A5": "Laugh out loud if something is funny.",
      "ipip_V5": "Am able to come up with new and different ideas.",
      "ipip_Q5": "Tremble in dangerous situations.",
      "ipip_C5": "Worry about my health.",
      "ipip_R5": "Prefer friends who are excitingly unpredictable.",
      "ipip_H5": "Get excited by new ideas.",
      "ipip_V6": "Get impatient when others talk to me about their problems.",
      "ipip_Q6": "Play a role in order to impress people.",
      "ipip_N06": "Was down in the dumps.",
      "ipip_R6": "Like to be thought of as a normal kind of person.",
      "ipip_R7": "Repeatedly check doors, windows, and drawers.",
      "ipip_N07": "Had trouble keeping my mind on what I was doing.",
      "ipip_E7": "Am not bothered by disorder.",
      "ipip_H7": "Make jokes.",
      "ipip_A7": "Express my happiness in a childlike manner.",
      "ipip_N08": "Felt depressed.",
      "ipip_C8": "Feel healthy and vibrant most of the time.",
      "ipip_V8": "Have a broad outlook on what is going on.",
      "ipip_R8": "Get into moods where I feel very speeded up and irritable.",
      "ipip_R9": "Would enjoy campaigning for political office.",
      "ipip_E9": "Am not in touch with my feelings.",
      "ipip_V9": "Do not exercise on a regular basis.",
      "ipip_H9": "Am willing to talk about myself.",
      "ipip_N09": "Felt that everything I did was an effort.",
      "ipip_V10": "Am trusted to keep secrets.",
      "ipip_X10": "Rarely notice my emotional reactions.",
      "ipip_A10": "Keep my feelings to myself, regardless of how unhappy I am.",
      "ipip_N10": "Felt hopeful about the future.",
      "ipip_R10": "Begin to answer before the other person finishes the question.",
      "ipip_D11": "Seldom experience sudden intuitive insights.",
      "ipip_A11": "Am unaffected by other people's happiness.",
      "ipip_R11": "Talk a lot.",
      "ipip_V11": "Have taken frequent stands in the face of strong opposition.",
      "ipip_R12": "Don't finish the things that I start.",
      "ipip_Q12": "See myself as an average person.",
      "ipip_H12": "Laugh aloud.",
      "ipip_A12": "Find it difficult showing people that I'm angry with them.",
      "ipip_V12": "Don't quit a task before it is finished.",
      "ipip_N12": "Thought about killing myself.",
      "ipip_V13": "Do not easily share my feelings with others.",
      "ipip_B13": "Had the experience of feeling that my body did not belong to me.",
      "ipip_N13": "Had restless sleep.",
      "ipip_R13": "Might enjoy the thrill of being lost at sea.",
      "ipip_A13": "Rarely get caught up in the excitement.",
      "ipip_X14": "Have a vivid imagination.",
      "ipip_A14": "Can't help but look upset when something bad happens.",
      "ipip_Q14": "Have a strong personality.",
      "ipip_N14": "Felt happy.",
      "ipip_V15": "Have never deliberately hurt anyone.",
